    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN201 · Assessment 3/5</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment (01)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13792 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN201 · Đầu điểm 3/5</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment (01)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13792 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Presentation in class (end of the course)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Suggestion: Choose some case study using the studied models to evaluate and explain the situation.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1,500-word report and presentation handout</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Thinking creatively, making decisions, solving problems,<br>Personal qualities: Individual responsibility, self-esteem, sociability, self-management, and integrity.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">By instructor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Member scores need not be the same within each group. Recommended 30% for presentation, 70% for report.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 50 — Essay test (Progress Test) - Review</li><li>Session 51 — Essay test (Progress Test)</li><li>Session 55 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Session 56 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Session 57 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Session 58 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Session 59 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Session 60 — Presentation of Group Assignment[Practice: 4 period(s)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 50 — Essay test (Progress Test) - Review</li><li>Buổi 51 — Essay test (Progress Test)</li><li>Buổi 55 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Buổi 56 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Buổi 57 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Buổi 58 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Buổi 59 — Presentation of Group Assignment</li><li>Buổi 60 — Presentation of Group Assignment[Practice: 4 period(s)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=FIN201\">Exam Room — FIN201</a> (1 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=FIN201\">Phòng thi — FIN201</a> (1 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
